# Only web/ and the two packages it links to are needed to build the site.
#
# Every pattern is root-anchored with a leading slash, and that is load-bearing:
# a bare `services` matches any path segment with that name, which silently
# excluded web/app/services/ and removed three routes from the build. The
# failure surfaced far away, as typedRoutes rejecting a link to a route that no
# longer existed.
/contracts
/cre
/bazantic
/chainlink
/hedera
node_modules
.git
